      "placement": "center",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 250,
      "text": "Orléans, vers 1710. L’aube blanchit la pierre de Sainte-Croix. Sur la place, une marchande finit d’installer son panier pendant qu’un garde surveille une rue encore froide."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "marchande",
      "speaker": "La marchande",
      "preset": "marchande-truculente",
      "placement": "left",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 160,
      "text": "Vous pourriez sourire, monsieur le garde. À force de regarder les gens comme ça, vous allez finir par leur faire payer le passage."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "sentinelle",
      "speaker": "La sentinelle",
      "preset": "sentinelle-nerveuse",
      "rate": "+24%",
      "volume": "+10%",
      "placement": "right",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 120,
      "text": "Reculez votre panier. Et gardez la rue libre."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "marchande",
      "speaker": "La marchande",
      "preset": "marchande-truculente",
      "rate": "+16%",
      "volume": "+8%",
      "placement": "left",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 160,
      "text": "À cette vitesse-là, celui qui arrive n’apporte sûrement pas des fleurs."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "sentinelle",
      "speaker": "La sentinelle",
      "preset": "sentinelle-nerveuse",
      "rate": "+15%",
      "volume": "+6%",
      "placement": "right",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 130,
      "text": "Occupez-vous de vos pommes. Le courrier ne vous regarde pas."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "marchande",
      "speaker": "La marchande",
      "preset": "marchande-truculente",
      "rate": "+14%",
      "volume": "+6%",
      "placement": "left",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 250,
      "text": "Mes pommes, elles, ont au moins la politesse de répondre quand on leur parle."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "narrateur",
      "speaker": "Narrateur",
      "preset": "narrateur-vif",
      "rate": "+6%",
      "placement": "center",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 260,
      "text": "Le cavalier a déjà tourné au coin de la rue. La marchande remet tranquillement deux fruits en place, comme si elle n’avait rien remarqué."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "marchande",
      "speaker": "La marchande",
      "preset": "marchande-truculente",
      "rate": "+12%",
      "volume": "+5%",
      "placement": "left",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 160,
      "text": "Vous voyez ? Pas une seule pomme n’a déserté."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "sentinelle",
      "speaker": "La sentinelle",
      "preset": "sentinelle-nerveuse",
      "rate": "+8%",
      "volume": "+2%",
      "placement": "right",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 120,
      "text": "Pour l’instant. Et vous parlez toujours trop."
    },
    {
      "character_id": "sentinelle",
      "speaker": "La sentinelle",
      "preset": "sentinelle-nerveuse",
      "rate": "-8%",
      "pitch": "-2Hz",
      "volume": "-8%",
      "placement": "right",
      "acoustic_space": "outdoor-open",
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "text": "Chut."
    },
    {
